From bbf968e6a2974925794bd8f2250e2db154c44b9d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paradox Computer <dev@paradox.computer>
Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 18:55:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(wallet): encrypted storage + account list --json +
 export verbs

Rebased onto v0.2.2. WalletCore::new() is async and takes a statistics_path
upstream now, so the four constructors thread password/mnemonic through that
shape; the JSON listing moved into handle_list(), which upstream factored out of
the match arm.
